<title>PERU: Peru's Banco Wiese 9-mo net flat.</title>
<headline>Peru's Banco Wiese 9-mo net flat.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 76.0 million soles vs 76.0 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 706.3 million soles vs 495.1 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Banco Wiese is Peru's second largest commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134 REUTER SH</p>
